{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_03_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_03","title":"外來者","storyCode":"SV-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"a46481401ffbbf64084e986fd4a5eb93d52ca2f23d057a24121f9a9b8fd9f935","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂見證了當地居民向大海求取食物的特殊儀式。憤怒的年輕審判官打斷了儀式，並認定斯卡蒂是邪惡的阿戈爾人，與斯卡蒂一番纏鬥。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你回來啦！我正準備去找你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上怎麼沾了些沙子......你到海邊去啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"都叫你不要去啦，可是你偏不聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"快跟我進屋裡去吧，裡面暖和些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這個給你，我找到吃的了。我把我縫了一半的衣服給了壁爐叔，從他那裡拿了這些，他那裡還剩下不少吃的，應該不在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"還有好久才入冬呢，我再勤快些，總能找到能用的布料的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些貝肉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們吃的到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你抓得我好疼啊......你力氣可太大啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們吃的到底是什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是岸上撿的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的海沒有食物。沒有任何收獲。這片海已經安靜下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了呀，你今天去，岸上當然不會有吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"要到那個時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"一百......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"一百！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！我都沒注意數字。原來已經到一百了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿得到了某個信號，原本分散在街道各處、各自“忙碌”的人們聚集到了一起。\n他們嘴裡念著同樣的數字，圍在一個罐子周圍，一個接著一個，從罐子裡摸出一樣東西，然後沉默著離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個罐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是問我，這些食物都是從哪來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"每當潮汐起落一百次，大人們就會像這樣，聚在一起，每人從罐子裡摸一個貝殼出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"罐子裡的貝殼大多數都是白色的，只有一個是紅色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"拿到紅色貝殼的那個人，等到天黑之後，他就會去海邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"到了第二天早上，海岸上就會鋪滿食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"去海裡生活了。就像律法說的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這也信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你想他去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......一百，終於到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，木框，你那是什麼表情？這是個好日子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"很快，我們之中，又有一個幸運的人被選中。他先我們一步，去過更好的生活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"等明天，新鮮的食物，我們都會有。大家都會活下去。無論是去海裡的，還是留在岸上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用著急。你已經足夠大了。你很快也會加入進來，得到這偉大的，機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你可以和過去一樣。祝福那位兄弟姐妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮，我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你摔倒了。真是沒用。剛才，海邊的事，弄軟了你的腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白為什麼。我，我好餓......我沒力氣。我病了......我要死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"對，貝殼呢？我剛拿出來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"掉地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是......是不是紅色的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我，可以去海裡生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"到了海裡，肚子就不餓了。是這樣的吧，鐵皮？我會過上，好生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你也會......呃， 跟教士說的那樣，祝福我的，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你看錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好，這是你的貝殼。看看清楚，這是什麼顏色。別讓鹽水迷了你的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"白色的？為什麼會是白色......我看錯了嗎？不會啊。我的眼睛，很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撥琴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，這東西是這麼用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，鐵皮，你手裡的貝殼......你的手，捏得好緊。是不是要流血了？紅紅的，我看見了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要祝福的話，我這裡沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是有意義的。至少，我知道，該往哪裡去。我馬上就要知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都在幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這身打扮......是審判官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官為什麼會突然出現在這裡？他們很少來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"上次有審判官過來還是好幾年前......那時候我還很小，我們都過得很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡再找不到吃的了，還有很多人病倒。到處一片混亂，每天都有人死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官帶走了幾個人。那些人再也沒有回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的日子稍微好過了些，我們還在餓死，或者病死，但至少不會，呃，不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟......那是審判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，歌手，別惹她，她看起來可不大高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡正在發生的事，我都看見了，也聽到了。你們在謀劃著把人送到海裡去......你們知不知道自己在做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"說話啊！為什麼不說話？不對勁，這裡的一切都不對勁。疾病，饑荒......我本來以為我會看見，因為難以避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"根據之前傳來的消息，過了這麼多年，你們根本就不該活著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"可是真實情況不一樣。你們看起來比我想的要好，卻也糟糕得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——理解這樣的行為會導致的後果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"看著我，回答我！你們知道我是誰吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你是審判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你必須回答我，市民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這是大海的選擇。被選中的那一個，他自己接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這不對！說什麼大海的選擇，就像海本身有什麼意志一樣......真是可怕的話語！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看見，你們在進行一場集體謀殺！走進海裡的人，他怎麼可能活下來？你們......你們憑什麼給無辜者判刑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"去海裡，不是死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不管。我只知道，他的下場，可能會比死亡更可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，我親眼看見，你們在逼迫你們之中的某一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我們要他做什麼，這是他自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他想去海邊，我們不該攔下他。律法沒有說他不能這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"胡言亂語，這並不正確！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，什麼是正確的呢？你是審判官，你可以向我們指出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，我比你們更清楚什麼是錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在進行的是一種不被容許的行為。哪怕你們不承認，我還是嗅到了邪惡的氣息——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"（拔劍）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們竟然不怕我的劍。或許，你們真的不認為這是一場謀殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們連死亡都不怕。你們正在變成怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者......有人想把你們變成怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的瘋狂，或許是被什麼人蠱惑，我一定會把罪惡的源頭找出來，我發誓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她忍不住了，不關我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她是誰？你是說......審判官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總要讓她試試的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路上找了很多間屋子啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不必跟著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"像這樣一間間找下去，你真的能找到你要找的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就一直找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"從城北走到城南，城西走到城東，要一兩天哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不跟著我，我能走更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"要你來的人知不知道你在找她？她沒有說具體位置嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，等一會天就要黑啦，還是歇歇吧。歌手，你今天準備住在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以跟我回去。我說過的，北邊的房子相對好些，我們許多人都住在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧，上次的鱗油還剩下些，壁爐叔早早點好了燈，屋子裡亮亮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂隨意踢開路邊的一扇門。那扇門屬於一間塌了一半的房子。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就住這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這房子？這房子可很久沒住過人哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"別說床鋪，這裡連個平整些的角落都難找。躺不下去的話，你怎麼睡覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站著，坐著，無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好厲害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪啊，我是不知道流浪歌手是什麼樣，可你給我的感覺不像他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為愛唱歌的人，都會很愛說笑。不像你，你連話都很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，愛跳舞的人，會像你這樣不在意地坐在滿是塵土的地方，把裙子弄髒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你嫌我煩啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是什麼好地方，你說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可我想陪陪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用人陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我發現了。你坐在屋裡，眼睛一直在看著外面。你在看哪裡？海邊，還是教堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是晚上還想出去？比如說，爬上山，進教堂看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是和我沒關係。我只是好奇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你的琴？你給我這個幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總看這個。你想要，就拿走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......好漂亮的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"（叮咚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"真好聽。可我不會用它，我只想看你用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是覺得，我是想要你的東西，才總跟著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我就是想跟著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你心裡只想找人，找你的那個同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我需要確認一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是有很多年都在找她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我的感覺是這樣。一提到找她，你的眼神就變了。這是走過很多路的人的眼神。佩特拉奶奶有時候就會露出這個眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"很好啊。要我說，你終於能擺脫她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這種包袱太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你堅持個多少年，二三十年後，無論是你還是她，都只會想著要解脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"況且沒什麼人能堅持那麼長的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，你說不定是命特別好的那種人。你不用再找她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們這裡，只有沒包袱的人才能活得久些。要是腦子裡一直想一件事情，人就會發瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你別看我沒活多少年，我見過發瘋的人可多哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不懂你們過去發生過什麼。但過去的事，好的不好的，積得多了，都會把人壓壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"就像佩特拉奶奶每提一次曼紐爾這個名字，我都知道她的病又重了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你還年輕，你不用過得這麼辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單不簡單的，你可以說說看啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我就在這裡，我想聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去想，也不會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是不去想，它們越會找上你，淹沒你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"給，你也喝一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（仰頭喝下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"停——別一口灌太多，給我留一點。我晚上睡不著還要靠這個呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，唉。你呀，你這人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼你自己就是災禍，都是你害死的胡安......我這個當老子的還沒來得及罵你，你就這副半死不活的樣子。你叫我能說什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"真*伊比利亞粗口*鬱悶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的目標是我。靠近我的，都沒有好下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧你這話說的，咒我是不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好也離我遠些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，你不說我也有這打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，不是說老子就信了你*米諾斯粗口*的邪。幹這行就是刀尖舔血，臭小子不聽老子的勸，死了，還是死在不知什麼鬼玩意的手裡，連你都沒辦法，我又能怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"這仇我報不了。我也沒法對你做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"喝完這點酒，以後我們就大路朝天，各走各邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這混球！你就一直這個性子？你連一句好話都說不出來，那壞話總能講點吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的語言到現在我都不太會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"不對。你就是不肯和別人說你當他們是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。要再見了，索性多廢幾句話。你之後準備往哪裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"還要像過去那樣，漂來漂去，接些不痛不癢的任務，應付一波又一波敵不上你一根手指的敵人，就像活在一個永遠醒不來的夢裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂仰頭痛飲。但酒精似乎對她毫無作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"那你說，我能去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們做賞金獵人，都是為了賺錢，為了生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"可我早就什麼都沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"蠻荒，無序。連自動馬桶都沒有。我不想待在這裡，這裡也不需要我。我為什麼要在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱，無知。明明又貪婪又怕死，也不瞭解我，在它們找來的時候，卻不肯自己躲開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想不明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，你捏碎幾個酒瓶了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"斬殺獵物。解決敵人。我天生就是幹這個的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都死了，而我活了下來。我活下來是為了什麼？為什麼這些災難總會找上門，但又殺不掉我......總是殺掉我身邊的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用你來告訴我，你這個阿戈爾婆娘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼？為什麼死的是他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我在等，在找，我一定得把那些追著我的影子全殺了，可我根本找不到，我看都看不見他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我該怎麼辦？除了遠離所有人，我還能怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"還有誰......誰能告訴我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，好吧。你*薩爾貢粗口*贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我把這一瓶都留給你。你把它喝完，試著和我一樣哭一場，然後好好睡一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼用，我都試過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"做夢去吧，獵人。對你來說，夢或許比較真。搞不好，夢裡能有一些線索——比方說，只屬於你的，呃，藏寶圖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老何塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"找到它。然後你就可以更好地上路了。悶頭往前，總比原地打轉好得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藏寶圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手？你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你有一會看著好痛苦......我沒想過你會有這種表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你開始捏這個東西。要不是你這麼寶貝它，我還以為它是什麼壞東西，氣得你想捏碎它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你......看上去並不像是在生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是她的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她？是你要找的那個同伴吧？好吧，看來你真的不肯放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她不是包袱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她......幫了我。她讓我看到了一條航線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沿著這個方向一直駛下去，或許我就能找到答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你在找什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不知道。可能是我是誰。也可能是我該幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......你們在廢墟裡找東西的時候，會知道自己能找到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這麼說的話，我還真不知道哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，等找到了就知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你可別頂撞她，把門打開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是伊比利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你隨便說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那是審判官。審判官......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在這裡，別以為你裝得很好，你一進城我就看到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把門打開，市民，你不知道自己窩藏了什麼人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"窩藏？不，我、我沒有故意藏什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會數三聲，不開門的話，別怪我不客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一、二——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"三！咳，咳咳，這麼大的灰，這地方多久沒人待了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，阿戈爾人，你果然在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"審判官的劍很利很快，就連空氣都幾乎被劈成兩半。\n本該在劍鋒下的人彎下了腰，以一種不可思議的動作滑到了一邊。\n她貼著劍鋒，劍鋒緊跟著她，卻觸不到她的髮梢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好快的動作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手......躲開了？！這個姿勢......我連想都想不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她站在椅......椅背上？那種地方也能站人嗎？她為什麼站得那麼穩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不過僥倖而已！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我倒要看看，你的好運氣，能用到什麼時候？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"又躲開了！咻地一下就——從屋子這邊到了另一邊。簡直比大風刮起來的海草還要輕、還要快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那根棍子對我沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"棍......子？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這等侮辱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你會為你的錯誤言辭付出代價！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊——力道也好大！椅子裂開了，然後是櫃子，就連地面也出現了裂痕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不敢看......可歌手她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，沒事？全部躲過去了嗎？好靈活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不......她不像在躲避，她的步伐一點都不狼狽，反而有種奇特的節奏感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......好、好美。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"汗水從年輕的審判官發紅的面龐上滴下來。她拿劍的手依然很穩，可她呼吸的頻率在加快。\n狹小的空間被切得七零八碎。對斯卡蒂來說，卻和在寬闊的荒野上緩步慢行沒有兩樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你要躲到什麼時候，阿戈爾人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"和你的其他族人一樣，潛入我們國家，在陰影裡躲躲藏藏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......劈歪了嗎？這一劍砍中了牆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官她......是不是累了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我的劍沒有歪的時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"牆、牆塌了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，我們都在另一邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可是歌手......她沒有退路了。審判官是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"現在——看你躲到哪裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"接受這一劍，這就是對你的罪行的審判！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_03_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的劍，就這樣隨隨便便被擋了下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖說我也沒有使出全力......阿戈爾人，你到底是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！從你進入鹽風城，我就一直在跟著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糊弄誰呢......流浪歌手哪有你這種身手？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......看來何塞先生白忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"何塞又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有你在海邊做的事，我都看到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"審判官接連出劍，劈砍，突刺，每一劍都比之前更快、更精準。\n她不再只攻擊面前的阿戈爾人，而是不斷變換著角度，高速切割周圍的空間。如果敵人沒有破綻，她將會用劍術逼出對方的破綻。\n然而斯卡蒂全身都是破綻。她根本沒有防禦的意圖。\n輕巧的劍擊全部消融在一記記了無痕跡的悶響裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快交代！你潛入這裡的意圖是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你管得太多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不光不怕審判官，而且還在嘲諷她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者也不是嘲諷。歌手她說話一直這個樣子，半天下來我都習慣了。不過......咳，審判官現在更生氣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_03_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可是......審判官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亞發生的事，沒有什麼與我們無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有為律法所不容的錯事......我們發現，我們抹平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這邊的海不對勁。它們的數量在增長。這座城市即將......不，或許已經變成邪惡的巢穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，阿戈爾人。這一切異常，都是你帶來的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你帶來了災禍，讓它們聚集在此處——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你向這裡的居民灌輸了異端的思想，慫恿他們到海裡去。看看他們，現在變得和你們一樣古怪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你明明看到了。你清楚這裡的海發生了什麼。然而看看你的眼神——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你根本就，不關心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的冷漠，哪裡像一個普通人類？你還敢說這不是你做的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你跑掉的，阿戈爾人——！你們給這個國家帶來的災難還少嗎？你們在盤算什麼，我可都清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"審判官在說什麼呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歌手她才剛來半天時間......而且什麼災禍，什麼古怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到海裡去......不是我們自願的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼阿戈爾人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你打不過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不多試試怎麼知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"純屬浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。你說的對。我和你廢這些話做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我早就應該——先拿下你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"審判官突然收劍。她從身側拔出手炮，雙手握緊，對準斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趴下。別出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，阿戈爾人，知道我的厲害了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍裙擺）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多了一個彈孔，不能原樣還給何塞先生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你！你竟然毫髮無傷！這怎麼會？我明明都瞄準了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要繼續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的武器。你使用起來並不輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，你現在不會和我說話。你應該瞄準第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的話，我聽不懂，也不關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道光刺破了黑夜，直直打在斯卡蒂臉上。\n光的來處，道路的盡頭，出現一個提燈的人影。\n斯卡蒂的面龐上沒什麼表情，剛才的不耐煩也一同消失。\n而在看到那道不算太明亮的光的一瞬間，審判官的眼神便一起亮了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
